Building (gcc)
--------------

You're supposed to use riscv64-unknown-elf, but any riscv64 gcc toolchain *should* work.
I personally use riscv64-linux-musl because it's in my distro repos.

    make CROSS_COMPILE=riscv64-unknown-elf-

Building (clang)
----------------

    make \
        CC=clang CFLAGS='--target=riscv64' \
        AS=clang ASFLAGS='--target=riscv64 -c' \
        LD=ld.lld

Running
-------

    ./run.sh
